<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="521416693"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1315768443"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="So Far Away"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Martin Garrix / David Guetta / Jamie Scott / Romy Dya"/><amll:meta key="album" value="So Far Away"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:00.823"><div begin="00:12.775" end="03:00.983"><p begin="00:12.775" end="00:15.023" itunes:key="L1">Light 'em up, light 'em up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点亮希望 点亮希望</span></p><p begin="00:15.033" end="00:18.030" itunes:key="L2">Tell me where you are, tell me where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我你在哪里 你在哪里</span></p><p begin="00:19.348" end="00:22.860" itunes:key="L3">Summer nights, bright lights and the shooting stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">炎热夏夜 明亮的灯光</span></p><p begin="00:23.133" end="00:24.709" itunes:key="L4">They break my heart</p><p begin="00:25.001" end="00:27.765" itunes:key="L5">Calling you now but you're not picking up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在给你打电话 但你并没有接</span></p><p begin="00:28.017" end="00:31.073" itunes:key="L6">Shadows so close if that's still enough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否还爱着我 而你的身影总是挥之不去</span></p><p begin="00:32.062" end="00:34.327" itunes:key="L7">Light a match, light a match<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">划亮一支火柴 划亮一支火柴</span></p><p begin="00:34.337" end="00:37.421" itunes:key="L8">Baby in the dark, show me where you are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 在这黑暗之中 告诉我你在哪里</span></p><p begin="00:39.530" end="00:40.636" itunes:key="L9">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="00:41.092" end="00:45.318" itunes:key="L10">How I miss you every single day when I see you on those streets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天我都是那样想你</span></p><p begin="00:45.895" end="00:46.986" itunes:key="L11">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="00:47.526" end="00:51.648" itunes:key="L12">Tell me there's a river I can swim that will bring you back to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我总有一条通向你的河流</span></p><p begin="00:52.025" end="00:54.858" itunes:key="L13">'Cause I don't know how to love someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了你我不知道该怎样爱别人</span></p><p begin="00:55.267" end="00:58.048" itunes:key="L14">I don't know how to forget your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道该怎样忘记你的脸</span></p><p begin="00:58.875" end="00:59.830" itunes:key="L15">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="01:00.332" end="01:04.854" itunes:key="L16">God, I miss you every single day and now you're so far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上帝啊 我每一天都是那样想你</span></p><p begin="01:09.584" end="01:11.215" itunes:key="L17">So far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样遥远</span></p><p begin="01:17.182" end="01:19.417" itunes:key="L18">It's breakin' me, I'm losing you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去你让我的心支离破碎</span></p><p begin="01:19.427" end="01:22.575" itunes:key="L19">We were far from perfect, but we were worth it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我们不是最完美的恋人 但我们值得这一切</span></p><p begin="01:23.577" end="01:27.453" itunes:key="L20">Too many fights, and we cried, but never said we're sorry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们有过太多争吵和哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:27.679" end="01:29.331" itunes:key="L21">Stop saying you love me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再对我说爱我了</span></p><p begin="01:29.341" end="01:32.261" itunes:key="L22">You're calling me now, but I can't pick up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今你正在给我打电话 但我却无法接起来</span></p><p begin="01:32.528" end="01:35.526" itunes:key="L23">Your shadow's still close, and I'm still in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的身影依然萦绕在我身边 我还爱着你</span></p><p begin="01:36.137" end="01:40.111" itunes:key="L24">The summer's over now, but somehow, it still breaks my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今夏季已经结束 但我还是觉得</span></p><p begin="01:40.121" end="01:42.980" itunes:key="L25">We could have had the stars, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们本可以一起欣赏满天繁星</span></p><p begin="01:43.908" end="01:45.008" itunes:key="L26">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="01:45.267" end="01:49.777" itunes:key="L27">How I miss you every single day when I see you on those streets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天我都是那样想你</span></p><p begin="01:50.323" end="01:51.345" itunes:key="L28">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="01:51.913" end="01:56.023" itunes:key="L29">Tell me there's a river I can swim that will bring you back to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我有一条通向你的河流</span></p><p begin="01:56.459" end="01:59.280" itunes:key="L30">'Cause I don't know how to love someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了你我不知道该怎样爱别人</span></p><p begin="01:59.736" end="02:02.435" itunes:key="L31">I don't know how to forget your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道该怎样忘记你的脸</span></p><p begin="02:03.323" end="02:04.284" itunes:key="L32">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="02:04.618" end="02:09.238" itunes:key="L33">God, I miss you every single day when you're so far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上帝啊 我每一天都是那样想你</span></p><p begin="02:13.972" end="02:15.673" itunes:key="L34">So far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样遥远</span></p><p begin="02:20.436" end="02:22.137" itunes:key="L35">So far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样遥远</span></p><p begin="02:26.979" end="02:28.967" itunes:key="L36">So far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此遥不可及</span></p><p begin="02:33.178" end="02:34.905" itunes:key="L37">So far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那样遥远</span></p><p begin="02:35.532" end="02:36.565" itunes:key="L38">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="02:37.120" end="02:41.460" itunes:key="L39">How I miss you every single day when I see you on those streets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天我都是那样想你</span></p><p begin="02:41.872" end="02:43.181" itunes:key="L40">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="02:43.436" end="02:47.799" itunes:key="L41">Tell me there's a river I can swim that will bring you back to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我有一条通向你的河流</span></p><p begin="02:47.903" end="02:50.825" itunes:key="L42">'Cause I don't know how to love someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了你我不知道该怎样爱别人</span></p><p begin="02:51.235" end="02:54.710" itunes:key="L43">I don't know how to forget your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道该怎样忘记你的脸</span></p><p begin="02:54.720" end="02:55.854" itunes:key="L44">Oh, love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="02:56.325" end="03:00.983" itunes:key="L45">God, I miss you every single day when you're so far away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上帝啊 我每一天都是那样想你</span></p></div></body></tt>